      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Before I choose a workflow, please tell me:\n- Were the values log-transformed before centering?\n  You wrote: \"I'm unsure whether the values were log-transformed before the centering\". BONOBO's contract: \"the agent requires the caller to declare log_transformed=true and centered=true because BONOBO assumes log-transformed centered expression\".\n\nNo workflow has been selected and nothing runs before you answer.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
